Ok here are the details:

Seeing as this was my first ascension I was both over prepared and
under equipped if that makes any sense.#

The game started off with little to distinguish it from a thousand
other games, I found no decent armour at all on the first few levels
but dipped for Excalibur and thanks to a bit of luck with a very large
bookshop was able to get lots of scrolls ID'd early. This gave me a +3
Excalibur and a large stack of +4 daggers early on.
I blitzed Sokoban and the Mines which gave me a BoH and the luckstone.
A co-aligned temple in Minetown helped matters along and then I found
a WoW.
I wished up a Grey DSM and I was off.... until I opened a chest
without checking for traps and fried the wand. DOH! Amateur mistake.
In a sulk I wandered down a few more levels and came across a mind
flayer.....he got one hit on me before I realised (the poor old PDA is
a bit worn now and pressing the directional pad sometimes jumps you
two presses instead of one) I didn't realise how much memory i'd lost
until I went back upstairs...blank level...and the one above that.
bring up the inventory...loads of un-id'd stuff. DAMN!

Fortunately my luck held and a magic marker was found, I still knew ?
oI so a trip back to minetown got me loads of b?oI via a water prayer.
I then fixed up my kit and thanks to a =oL raced across the water to
take on Medusa. Towel wrapped around my head I slash wildly and slew
the beast....  by this time a cloak of displacement had come my way
and almost all intrinsics I needed. The Castle yielded up Liches
galore so having offed them I got out my magic marker again and
genocided the lot. and those pesky mind flayers. phew!

at this point I dipped into the Valley and beat up the monsters and
went back up through the dungeaon to dump my old crap and sort out
what I would need later. It was at this point that I put my ?oGD in a
safe place. Kit in place and Exp high enough I romped the Quest. back
down into Gehemnom I had quite an easy time. I had found a silver
sabre and speed boots so I wished up GoP to replace my GoD and a Helm
of Brilliance to replace my "oR and Helm of Telepathy having found an
"oLS. quaffing !oH like a mad eejit I was soon over prepared and
hacked through the mazes easily. I didn't even bother to dig easy
